From: Yuri <urab@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mkporayfw: add 16M flash layout

Add a 16 MiB flash layout so poray-header can generate a factory
image with the existing WT3020 board definition and -F 16M.

---
 src/mkporayfw.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

--- a/src/mkporayfw.c
+++ b/src/mkporayfw.c
@@ -132,6 +132,9 @@ static struct flash_layout layouts[] = {
 		.id		= "8M",
 		.fw_max_len	= 0x7c0000,
 	}, {
+		.id		= "16M",
+		.fw_max_len	= 0xfc0000,
+	}, {
 		/* terminating entry */
 	}
 };
